oded\'] + df[\'savings_status_encoded\']", "# debt_to_income_ratio\\n# Feature description: Ratio of loan credit_amount to the product of duration and installment commitment (proxy for income). Larger values indicate higher relative debt burden.\\n# Usefulness: Captures relative affordability of the credit. Reflects financial burden and repayment capacity.\\n\\ndf[\'debt_to_income_ratio\'] = df[\'credit_amount\'] / (df[\'duration\'] * df[\'installment_commitment\'])", "# experience_stability_ratio\\n# Feature description: Ratio of age to employment length (label-encoded). Higher values indicate individuals who are older relative to their employment duration.\\n# Usefulness: Provides insights into financial habits and delayed career trajectory, affecting long-term risk.\\n\\ndf[\'employment_encoded\'] = df[\'employment\'].map({\'unemployed\': 0, \'<1\': 1, \'1<=X<4\': 2, \'4<=X<7\': 3, \'>=7\': 4})\\ndf[\'experience_stability_ratio\'] = df[\'age\'] / df[\'employment_encoded\']", "# credit_purpose_risk\\n# Feature description: Label encode purpose and compute interaction with credit_amount to create a risk-adjusted loan purpose feature.\\n# Usefulness: Helps to assess risk embedded in specific credit purposes coupled with loan size.\\n\\ndf[\'purpose_encoded\'] = df[\'purpose\'].map({\'radio/tv\': 1, \'new car\': 2, \'used car\': 3, \'education\': 4, \'business\': 5, \'furniture/equipment\': 6, \'other\': 7, \'repairs\': 8, \'domestic appliance\': 9, \'retraining\': 10})\\ndf[\'credit_purpose_risk\'] = df[\'credit_amount\'] * df[\'purpose_encoded\']", "# delayed_flag\\n# Feature description: Binary flag where credit_history is \'delayed previously\', indicating risky past behavior.\\n# Usefulness: Captures past defaults or delays in credit servicing, directly reflecting credit risk.\\n\\ndf[\'delayed_flag\'] = (df[\'credit_history\'] == \'delayed previously\').astype(int)", "# residence_duration_flag\\n# Feature description: Binary flag for individuals with residence_